# Whitelist approach: ignore everything (all RPG Maker XP bundled files such as
# RPGXP.exe, DLLs, rtp/, System/, Bonus/, Steam files), then re-allow only our own files.
/*

# Repository meta
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md

# Custom sources (scripts, tools, etc.)
!/Custom/

# Attributes editor (custom tool; must stay next to RPGXP.exe)
!/Attributes/
/Attributes/AttributesEditor.exe

# Build / editor junk anywhere
*.obj
*.pdb
*.tmp
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vs/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
